Admitted.

// HOL Light: Multivariate/metric.ml:25251 / OPEN_IN_PATH_COMPONENTS_OF_LOCALLY_PATH_CONNECTED_SPACE   (hash md5:d4ed2d13ccae8def392fc7a080241524)
