Theorem hlt_contractible_space_thm : forall A:set, A <> Empty -> forall top :e hl_ty_topology A, hl_contractible_space A top = 1 <-> exists a :e A, hl_homotopic_with A A (fun x :e A :^: A => if True then 1 else 0) (hl_pair (hl_ty_topology A) (hl_ty_topology A) top top) (fun x :e A => x) (fun x :e A => a) = 1.
Admitted.

